+
+| Window | Duration | Impact | Survival/avoidance |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Public `v0.5.0` while installed board embeds `v0.2.0` | `0s` dynamic mismatch | None from publication alone. | Exact immutable embedded pin. |
+| `W2`: task-board `0.25.0` install | First installed mutation to installed canary or rollback canary; measured, unbounded in advance | Default surface may mix five binaries, skill, roles and install state; new default spawn/route may fail. | Withhold default surface; saved current-pair with recovery PATH remains authority. |
