+| `W3`: agents-infra `v1.7.0` install | First managed binary replacement to installed canary or rollback canary; measured | Binary, model-harness, install state, `.agents`, links/helpers and receipt may mix; new composition may fail. | Saved current-pair; existing children/sessions keep process images; retry later mutations through saved pair. |
+| `0.25.0` installed while `v1.7.0` is not yet installed | Until Step 3 canary | Supported only if Step-2 live external-seam canary passed. | This is an explicit tested pair, not inferred independence. |
+| Public `v0.6.0` while both installed consumers embed `v0.5.0` | `0s` dynamic mismatch | None from publication alone. | Exact pins; no `@latest`. |
