+| Step-6 LLDB bypass guard | Before-snapshot through successful after-snapshot `cmp`; measured | No accepted mutation. A failed read/difference makes LLDB state unknown and may affect LLDB-enabled composition. | Mandatory `AGENTS_INFRA_SKIP_LLDB_MCP=1`; withhold new composition and stop on any non-identical result. |
